# Vercel deployment surface: dashboard UI + live API only.
# Keep the Python CLI/package, tests, agent configs, release docs, and other
# repository assets out of the Vercel source so Python zero-config never
# interprets agr/main.py or agrx/main.py as a web application.
# Framework Preset is managed in Vercel Project Settings and must remain Other.
/*
!api
!dashboard
!docs
!package.json
!vercel.json
